{"unit_id":"RyensX__dsh-message-navigation#readme-1","repo":"RyensX/dsh-message-navigation","commit":"b4091222495a6518ec7652def5a63a43527e42ce","type":"readme","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-message-navigation README · dsh-message-navigation：**中文** | [English](docs/README_EN.md)\n\n为DeepSeek Harness提供Codex风格用户消息导航栏。\n\n可通过该导航栏快速跳转发送的消息。","source":"extracted","section":"dsh-message-navigation"}
{"unit_id":"RyensX__dsh-message-navigation#readme-2","repo":"RyensX/dsh-message-navigation","commit":"b4091222495a6518ec7652def5a63a43527e42ce","type":"readme","lang":"en","text":"dsh-message-navigation README · 安装：Github安装：\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add github:RyensX/dsh-message-navigation\n```\n\n源码安装：\n\n```sh\npnpm install\npnpm build\ndsh plugin --profile web add .\n```\n\n卸载：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-message-navigation\n```","source":"extracted","section":"安装"}
